<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange finished mixed in heavy trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 5.39 to 6709.18, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.05 to 400.71.</p>
<p>The average price per share was unchanged.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1366 to 1159.</p>
<p>Volume was 443,476,810 compared with 545,749,090 Friday.</p>
